      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight of exhaustion and hopelessness right now, and that feeling of being trapped is truly agonizing. When the fight feels pointless, it can make you question everything, including your own worth. If the world feels like an endless loop of rejection, perhaps the most immediate thing you can do is find a small, quiet space just for yourself to breathe. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line; there are people who want to listen to you without judgment.",
